OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot dead as children gather
OL,4,Afor memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a 40-year-old man was
OL,8,Fshot dead in a "senseless act of
OL,9,Fviolence" as up to 50 people `
OL,10,Fincluding children ` gathered for a
OL,11,Fmemorial service in west London.
OL,13,FThe Met Police said it was called to
OL,14,Fthe scene at 19:47 GMT after multiple
OL,15,Fshots had been heard by members of the
OL,16,Fpublic at the junction of Braybrook
OL,17,FStreet and Erconwald Street in East
OL,18,FActon.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
